# SHA-256 checksum of an immutable migration's SQL, keyed by a migration name
# that happens to contain "password_reset". It is a content hash, not a credential.
#
# Gitleaks fingerprints pin a line number, so this entry breaks whenever anything
# above it in migration-policy.json moves. If the central Gitleaks workflow gains
# config support, replace this with a path/rule allowlist.
apps/api/prisma/migration-policy.json:generic-api-key:120
